@startuml 14-extend-not-rewrite
' Shared. From the original README slide 9.
!pragma layout smetana
title Extend, not rewrite
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

rectangle "spec/contracts/ — the only thing a project edits" as contracts #eef4fa {
    rectangle "mapping-project1.yaml" as Y1
    rectangle "mapping-project2.yaml" as Y2
    rectangle "tds/*.def"            as T1
    rectangle "schemas/*.json"          as S1
}

rectangle "implementations/* — zero code diff" as engine #f5fbf5 {
    rectangle "beam-dataflow · flink · flink-jdbc" as PIPE #dff0d8
}

Y1 --> PIPE
Y2 --> PIPE
T1 --> PIPE
S1 --> PIPE
note bottom of PIPE : project2: zero implementation diff (proven, beam).\nflink, flink-jdbc: same contracts, run pending.
@enduml
